ope with a shot that  could cure the infection  and as we see with the little girl this  actually worked  well on very few of the villagers other  villagers this  turned into lichens miranda also used  her shape-shifting abilities to make  herself appear as a holy angel  we see her likeness as a painting in the  village church and many villagers houses  and she bears a halo as in classical  paintings  on top of this she has given herself  wings which would also give her the look  of an angel coming down to save the  village from disease  we know for certain this is how the  villagers view her as they refer to her  as a mother miranda  giving her a holy title and in a letter  to louisa  one villager laments they broke in again  got more of the livestock  i don't think we'll make it through the  winter at this rate ernest is still  missing too  we can't find him anywhere has mother  miranda  abandoned us they even go so far as to  sacrifice  goats to mother miranda present her with  offerings and offer her goats of warding  for protection  they clearly worship her one more  interesting tidbit related to this is  that miranda is actually the crazy old  lady ethan runs into throughout the game  while some other villagers view her as  looney it seems mother miranda used this  form to propagate legends about herself  and  spread them throughout the village  likely helping to build her holy  image it's important to note that at one  point in time she started up a lab  within the village itself  where she began her research and even  had a team working with her  oswell e spencer the founder of umbrella  corporation  actually studied under her after staying  in her village  spencer notes in a letter that he came  to the village 15 years before writing  it  and mentions this took place after two  world wars and humanity was on the cusp  of another  meaning it was sometime around the cold  war as spencer mentions finding the  progenitor virus which was discovered in  1966  he 