oting that  while lady dimitrisk needs to ingest  human flesh and blood to maintain her  ability to regenerate  we're only told her daughters need to  consume meat this is probably why we see  hunks of meat strung up in the kitchen  however lady demetresque requires human  flesh  specifically so with that we turn to the  dungeons and torture chambers  as we learn from a poor maid there were  so many souls being tortured the wailing  rang through the halls sounding like  ghosts  after making a mistake she's brought  down to the cellar where we see  just what kind of treatment she'll  receive here we see horrifying devices  meant to poke and prod blood out of  their victim  blood lady demetresque would be able to  drink from we also find bodies hanging  over barrels  likely meant to collect their blood for  lady demontresque storage  not only that but lab equipment and the  serum to inject victims with kadu  we find a list of treatment candidates  with candidates and rejects  i believe the rejects were tortured for  their blood and the candidates would  receive an injection of the cadoo  possibly after being tortured for blood  because you know  a girl's gotta eat these candidates  would then transform into the  zombie-like creatures we see roaming the  halls as we can confirm thanks to one of  the four listed candidates  ingrid most are listed as having robust  appetites  which matches with the zombies attempts  to eat ethan and one specifically drops  ingrid's  necklace upon killing it confirming this  another one was sent to the seller she'd  only spilled some  soup everyone knows what happens when  you're sent to the cellar  you're never seen again they drain your  blood your soul cursed to wander the  halls  i went looking for her and when i found  her she was just skin  and bones and gnawing on a rat carcass  i suspect it'll be my turn next as it  would turn out  while all men were drained of their  blood without ever being turned  only the woman of the castle w