gie and  the fact that angie has strange scarring  across her own face  including a third eye on her forehead  this leads me to believe that angie was  actually made to represent donna  therefore giving her a playmate she  could relate to so it's pretty likely  i think that this scar we see across  angie's face  and even the third eye are exactly what  a young donna was dealing with making it  understandable why she would be so shy  unfortunately we don't know  too much about claudia beneviento other  than that she was probably donna's  little sister  and definitely meant a lot to her  tragically claudia who was born in 1987  died at the young age of just nine years  old and was buried with baron gario's  chalice  a family heirloom we find dolls and the  flower that donna used to create  hallucinations all  over this massive grave showing its  importance to not only the beneviento  family  but also to donner herself tragically  claudia wouldn't be the only family  member donna would lose as her parents  would also somehow die  after this donna locked herself away in  mourning and would only speak to her  doll angie  notably this would have been around or  after 1996.  and it seems around this time mother  miranda gave donna a visit and injected  her with the cadoo  i say that it seems that way based on  what we learned from the gardener  in the game's concept art we're told  that the scarred part of her face was  caused by the parasite  her base concept is that she's a ghost  if she had this scarring as a child and  it was caused by the parasite that would  mean she was actually injected far  earlier and only recently came into  favor with miranda  donna ended up another of the favorable  candidates with the kadu giving her  strange powers  physically she's no different from a  regular human however she can secrete a  signal producing substance which  controls plants infected by the muta my  seat  when humans absorb the pollen from a  particular flower she can cause them to  have hallucinations  however she is mentally underdeveloped  and has divided her cadoo among her  dolls in order to control them from a  distance  as miranda notes donna has a severe  mental illness  although it's unclear if this is as a  result of the cadoo or  one she already had also this explains  why the dolls move  they actually also have a part of  donna's could do in them which we see  when destroying angie  and hence why this also kills donna this  isn't the only ability she has though  and the alkaloids of a certain yellow  mountainous flower allow her to give  people hallucinations  she therefore has yosef plant these  flowers in the garden  which he also chooses to plant in front  of claudia's grave  it gives him hallucinations of his  departed wife which donna uses to coax  him into the beneviento manor  to see his family and where he is likely  mentally tortured  and slain the second lives deep in a  valley of mist  the doll maker donna beneviento  none of her playmates have ever come  back from that dank old  state it seems that donna's mental  illness has made her keep to herself and  coax people to be her twisted child like  playmates  while there is a lab we don't really see  any references to kudu being used or  injected in people here  so it's likely due to her mental illness  and spreading her gdu amongst her dolls  miranda didn't trust her with this  the third is moreau a being of twisted  flesh that lives in the reservoir past  the windmills  [Music]  it is said that he is not the only  monster that lives in those waters  there actually isn't too much we know  about salvatore moreau  other than he wasn't mentally sound we  do know that he enjoys watching old  romance movies and  really enjoys eating cheese both from  the concept art  and from the giant block of cheese we  can find in this chamber  he likely lived in the fishing village  we find him in but at some point miranda  injected him with the cadoo  and he had a a slightly better reaction  than most  that said his affinity to the kadu was  low and  either as a result of the injection or  just in general  he was extremely dimwitted as miranda  notes the could do caused  drastic changes to his internal organs  transforming them into organs similar to  fish like gills and a swim bladder  another subject with a regular cell  division causing him to transform into a  giant fish  the subject is unable to control this  transformation  it seems that fits of uncontrollable  vomit and pus are a telltale sign he's  about to transform  while moreau wasn't the sharpest tool in  the shed miranda did trust him with  performing more cadoo experiments  she also gave him a mountain where he  started a laboratory  and in one particular instance of  inspiration morrow tried injecting wolf  blood into a cadoo experiment's spine  this turned the subject into one of the  giant wolf-like monsters we see  throughout the game  moreau sees himself as an adopted child  of miranda's and is exceedingly upset  that she's trying to bring her real  daughter back  as he himself notes none of the other  children like him  and he thinks mother miranda does he's  afraid that she'll abandon him after ava  is brought back to life  as he's kind of a hopeless romantic as  indicated by his love of old romance  movies  it's very possible that he's in love  with miranda is thereby willing to do  terrible things for her  and is completely jealous of ethan sadly  as he's unaware she never cared for him  in the first place  and was only using him finally  we come to carl heisenberg the very  first of the lords that we meet  and the most powerful his affinity to  the cadoo is  incredibly favorable and his brain still  functions normally  as miranda states the cadoo has given  him electric organs similar to the  electric gray narkei japonica  these electric organs are connected to  the subject's nervous system  he can therefore pass and control  electricity throughout his entire  body 